{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54290","headline":"题鸣峯岩 二 · 郑良士","name":"题鸣峯岩 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"烟水苍苍鲤水南，千松万籁障精蓝。\n银釭剔起残灯焰，石鼎烹来新茗甘。\n罄响僧僮扬梵语，云迷佛阁隐瞿昙。\n道人去久知何处，明月年年照石龛。\n（《莆风清籁集》卷五四）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郑良士","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54290.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54290","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}